IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wcin-common`
IMPORT `wcin-dates`
IMPORT `wcin-wirc-2013`
IMPORT `wcin-aca-1985`
IMPORT `wcin-seat`

-- Victorian workers' compensation indexation notice, Gazette S 363 of 30 June 2026 -- worked cases for the injured worker's
-- seat (wcin-seat.l4), under both Acts and both columns.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Expected values were written by hand
-- from the printed rows of ../../registers/source-bundle/GG2026S363.txt (line numbers in the comments), with the
-- arithmetic shown; none was copied from the encoding's output. The amounts the Acts' own formulas give (the uncapped
-- weekly payment, the formula lump sum, the Schedule 4 total) are ILLUSTRATIVE inputs.
--
-- UNOFFICIAL VERSION: quotations from a plain-text conversion by Legalese Commons of the Gazette's PDF, not the published
-- Gazette. Victoria Government Gazette, published by IVE Group Limited with the authority of the Government Printer for the
-- State of Victoria. (c) State of Victoria 2026. "This publication is copyright. No part may be reproduced by any process
-- except in accordance with the provisions of the Copyright Act." Quoted under the owner's ruling of 24 October 2026
