§ `non-economic loss: the printed amounts (2013 Act lines 531-571; 1985 Act lines 255-272)`

-- s 211(2)(c)(i), lines 540-541: $26,530 and $3,980 from 1 July 2026; $25,730 and $3,860 before.
#ASSERT `provision in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a whole person impairment` 15) EQUALS JUST "s 211(2)(c)(i)"
