#ASSERT `printed amounts in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a modified whole person impairment` 10.5) EQUALS JUST (LIST 16430, 14000)
-- s 211(2)(b)(ii), lines 537-538: a modified spinal impairment of 10%: the same pair (finding 3).
#ASSERT `provision in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a modified spinal impairment` 10) EQUALS JUST "s 211(2)(b)(ii)"
#ASSERT `printed amounts in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a modified spinal impairment` 10) EQUALS JUST (LIST 16430, 14000)
-- A modified rating of 11% is outside (b) ("less than 11%") and falls in (c)(i).
#ASSERT `provision in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a modified whole person impairment` 11) EQUALS JUST "s 211(2)(c)(i)"
-- s 211(2)(c)(ii)(A) and (B), lines 542-547: a spinal impairment of 20%: $26,530 and $3,980.
#ASSERT `provision in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a spinal impairment` 20) EQUALS JUST "s 211(2)(c)(ii)(A) and (B)"
#ASSERT `printed amounts in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a spinal impairment` 20) EQUALS JUST (LIST 26530, 3980)
-- A spinal impairment of exactly 30% is not "less than 30%" and takes (c)(i) ("not more than 30%").
#ASSERT `provision in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a spinal impairment` 30) EQUALS JUST "s 211(2)(c)(i)"
-- Finding 3 READING: a modified spinal impairment is "a spinal impairment" for s 211(2)(c)(ii) (lines 542-547). At 15% and
-- at 11% (outside (b)(ii), "less than 11%"), it takes (c)(ii): $26,530 and $3,980. At 30% (not "less than 30%") it takes
-- (c)(i), "not more than 30%" (lines 540-541).
