#ASSERT `printed amounts in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a modified spinal impairment` 15) EQUALS JUST (LIST 26530, 3980)
#ASSERT `provision in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a modified spinal impairment` 11) EQUALS JUST "s 211(2)(c)(ii)(A) and (B)"
#ASSERT `provision in` (`the amounts the notice prints for my rating` `WIRC` `15 August 2026` `a permanent impairment` `a modified spinal impairment` 30) EQUALS JUST "s 211(2)(c)(i)"
